WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.071 --> 00:00:06.909
Sarah: This box will be the perfect stage.

2
00:00:06.910 --> 00:00:10.600
Riley: We're lucky your sister got a new piano!

3
00:00:10.601 --> 00:00:15.098
Theo: Frankie likes to jump on the piano keys.

4
00:00:15.099 --> 00:00:19.120
But Kelli gets mad.

5
00:00:19.121 --> 00:00:22.648
My dad will make a curtain for the stage. Theo's

6
00:00:22.649 --> 00:00:29.116
Dad: Hi, everyone. I am ready to help. Riley:

7
00:00:29.117 --> 00:00:32.694
It's the perfect day for a pet show. Ben:

8
00:00:32.695 --> 00:00:38.344
The weatherman said it might rain. Skyler:

9
00:00:38.345 --> 00:00:42.192
No way. There's not a cloud in the sky! Riley:

10
00:00:42.193 --> 00:00:48.990
Everyone can sit on the grass. Theo:

11
00:00:48.991 --> 00:00:52.151
Here they come now. Did

12
00:00:52.152 --> 00:00:55.059
you think of a trick for Speedy? Ben:

13
00:00:55.060 --> 00:01:00.411
Not really. Riley:

14
00:01:00.412 --> 00:01:09.111
Hi! Welcome to the Pet Lovers Club's first pet show! Ben:

15
00:01:09.112 --> 00:01:11.387
This is my turtle, Speedy. He

16
00:01:11.388 --> 00:01:14.440
can sit still for hours.

17
00:01:14.441 --> 00:01:17.994
Kids: That's not a trick!

18
00:01:17.995 --> 00:01:25.552
What's next?

19
00:01:25.553 --> 00:01:30.816
Theo: Now Frankie, my frog, will jump through a hoop.

20
00:01:30.817 --> 00:01:36.896
Frankie: Ribbit, ribbit!

21
00:01:36.897 --> 00:01:45.844
Kids: Yay! Hooray!

22
00:01:45.845 --> 00:01:49.516
Skyler: Next Chatter will tell a story.

23
00:01:49.517 --> 00:01:53.166
Chatter: Once upon a time! The end!

24
00:01:53.167 --> 00:01:57.651
Skyler: Chatter, you forgot the middle of the story!

25
00:01:57.652 --> 00:02:00.215
Chatter: Do your homework!

26
00:02:00.216 --> 00:02:05.013
Take out the garbage!

27
00:02:05.014 --> 00:02:08.925
Sarah: Now my cat Mittens will do flips in the air.

28
00:02:08.926 --> 00:02:20.713
And I will catch her!

29
00:02:20.714 --> 00:02:26.412
Theo: And now for the last trick.

30
00:02:26.413 --> 00:02:30.992
Riley: Snooks will find the hidden bone.

31
00:02:30.993 --> 00:02:46.763
Snooks, search!

32
00:02:46.764 --> 00:02:53.275
Theo: It's getting dark.

33
00:02:53.276 --> 00:02:55.742
And I hear thunder!

34
00:02:55.743 --> 00:02:58.358
Skyler: Here comes the rain.

35
00:02:58.359 --> 00:03:04.291
Sarah: And the wind.

36
00:03:04.292 --> 00:03:08.757
Riley: Snooks, come back! Oh no.

37
00:03:08.758 --> 00:03:14.786
Snooks is afraid of thunder!

